        "richtext_9B4K8T": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The LEGXI Heritage Minis collection transforms some of football's most iconic jerseys into finely crafted miniature collectibles.<\/p><p>Each Heritage Mini features a detailed 3D silicone jersey, carefully preserved within crystal-clear epoxy and encased for long-term display. Designed to capture the spirit of legendary moments, every piece serves as a lasting tribute to the athletes who shaped the game.<\/p><p>This special Argentine Trinity edition brings together three of the nation's most celebrated football icons:<\/p><ul><li>Lionel Messi<\/li><li>Diego Maradona<\/li><li>Ángel Di María<br\/><\/li><\/ul><p>Whether displayed on a desk, shelf, or collector's wall, these miniature jerseys preserve sporting history in a format designed for permanence.<\/p>",
            "position": "top_left"
          }
        }
      },
